d6D1o6r194vAbS962fEffg&oe=6AFC753F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Classigoo Quest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience immersive virtual reality like never before with our Meta Quest application, designed to deliver smooth performance, intuitive interactions, and engaging experiences. Step into beautifully crafted virtual environments where you can explore, interact, and enjoy content built specifically for VR. Whether you're a first-time VR user or an experienced enthusiast, the intuitive controls and comfortable navigation make it easy to jump in and start exploring.\n\nEnjoy realistic hand and controller interactions, immersive spatial audio, and optimized visuals that create a true sense of presence. Every detail has been designed to provide a seamless and enjoyable experience while taking full advantage of Meta Quest hardware.\n\nKey features include immersive virtual environments, responsive interactions, optimized performance, comfortable movement options, high-quality graphics, and an easy-to-use interface. Regular updates will continue to introduce new content, improvements, performance enhancements, and additional features based on user feedback.\n\nWhether your goal is to explore, learn, relax, or simply enjoy the possibilities of virtual reality, this application offers an engaging experience for users of all skill levels. Put on your headset, step into a new world, and discover an exciting VR experience built for the Meta Quest platform.\n", "short_description": "Classigoo incorporates virtual reality (VR) and augmented reality (AR) experiences to create immersive learning environments. Our platform offers interactive simulations and virtual field trips that allow students to explore complex concepts in a hands-on manner, making learning more engaging and memorable."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://adeels-organization-5.gitbook.io/classigoprivacypolicy/", "de